04:30 PM"},{"title":"RE Subject Leadership (3)","bookingform":"https://tally.so/r/kdxzR6?ICalUID=040000008200E00074C5B7101A82E00800000000E60E25B5CB3BDD01000000000000000010000000A5EFF76FD599BA4F91610BCF02B3AA60&EventTitle=RE%20Subject%20Leadership%20%283%29&Virtual=Yes&DiocesePrice=0&OtherPrice=0&Date=Monday%2C%2021%20June%202027&Start=3%3A45%20PM&End=5%3A15%20PM&Location=Microsoft%20Teams%20Meeting&Speakers=","description":"<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div class=\"cal_d6e3\">\r\n<div lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div class=\"x_WordSection1\">\r\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\">NEW course for 2026-27: for new RE leads and those who would like a refresher (cross-phase). This course takes place over three sessions which will introduce the key aspects of RE subject leadership. We will cover the statutory requirements\r\n and key documents to be aware of, RE curriculum development, how to support colleagues’ ongoing CPD and next steps for developing further as a subject leader. Key aspects of RE leadership in a Church school, including the SIAMS framework will also be addressed.</p>\r\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div class=\"me-email-text\" lang=\"en-GB\" style=\"max-width:1024px; color:#242424; font-family:'Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:24px; overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap\">\r\n________________________________________________________________________________</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><span class=\"me-email-text\" style=\"font-size:20px; color:#242424; font-weight:600\">Microsoft Teams meeting</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:6px\"><span class=\"me-email-text\" style=\"font-size:20px; color:#242424; font-weight:600\">Join:\r\n</span><a href=\"https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/351472524222800?p=xbvLeFmx3sO4iOwTi